{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First you click, then you chill. Welcome to an oddly satisfying clicker that rewards good aim and optimized builds. Click the balls to make them split. Get paid when you reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape: Pause/settings menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the balls to make them split.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the buttons to purchase upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRECISION CLICKING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/8d095b8797a5582365690b17116f5be8.poster.avif?t=1756959862\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/8d095b8797a5582365690b17116f5be8.webm?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/8d095b8797a5582365690b17116f5be8.mp4?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the balls to make them split. Try to reach the top of each level.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESS AND PRESTIGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c8b24f7840a66a63a96184973aa28c76.poster.avif?t=1756959862\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c8b24f7840a66a63a96184973aa28c76.webm?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c8b24f7840a66a63a96184973aa28c76.mp4?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get money when balls\u00a0hit the goal and when they bounce around.\u00a0Buy upgrades so you can complete the level objectives.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >METAPROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/ab31bf1c11602cc4a4616a750c503c6a.poster.avif?t=1756959862\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/ab31bf1c11602cc4a4616a750c503c6a.webm?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/ab31bf1c11602cc4a4616a750c503c6a.mp4?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play well and optimize your build so you can complete more difficult campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click without missing to increase your split multiplier. Try to hit multiple balls with one click. You need good aim and it's extremely hard, but you'll be rewarded for your skill. You don't need an auto clicker. You won't hurt your wrist or break your mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a lot of balls, watch them bounce around, and chill while you collect passive income. Idle play works just fine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the balls while they're on the top floor to score goals faster. Don't lose control of your balls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All meta upgrades get more expensive each time you make a purchase. Unoptimized builds are brutally punished.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulties add time limits and take away your metaprogression, so you have to get good if you want to win.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665640?t=1756959862","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665640?t=1756959862","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/b071a13062c7b0912703b79c7dfa067720476268/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756959862","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/b071a13062c7b0912703b79c7dfa067720476268/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756959862","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3665990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First you click, then you chill. Welcome to an oddly satisfying clicker that rewards good aim and optimized builds. Click the balls to make them split. Get paid when you reach the top.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONTROLS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape: Pause/settings menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the balls to make them split.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the buttons to purchase upgrades.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRECISION CLICKING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/8d095b8797a5582365690b17116f5be8.poster.avif?t=1756959862\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/8d095b8797a5582365690b17116f5be8.webm?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/8d095b8797a5582365690b17116f5be8.mp4?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the balls to make them split. Try to reach the top of each level.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESS AND PRESTIGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c8b24f7840a66a63a96184973aa28c76.poster.avif?t=1756959862\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c8b24f7840a66a63a96184973aa28c76.webm?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/c8b24f7840a66a63a96184973aa28c76.mp4?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get money when balls\u00a0hit the goal and when they bounce around.\u00a0Buy upgrades so you can complete the level objectives.\u200b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >METAPROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/ab31bf1c11602cc4a4616a750c503c6a.poster.avif?t=1756959862\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/ab31bf1c11602cc4a4616a750c503c6a.webm?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/extras/ab31bf1c11602cc4a4616a750c503c6a.mp4?t=1756959862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play well and optimize your build so you can complete more difficult campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click without missing to increase your split multiplier. Try to hit multiple balls with one click. You need good aim and it's extremely hard, but you'll be rewarded for your skill. You don't need an auto clicker. You won't hurt your wrist or break your mouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a lot of balls, watch them bounce around, and chill while you collect passive income. Idle play works just fine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the balls while they're on the top floor to score goals faster. Don't lose control of your balls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All meta upgrades get more expensive each time you make a purchase. Unoptimized builds are brutally punished.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulties add time limits and take away your metaprogression, so you have to get good if you want to win.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bergeronimo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665640/8f5f5f49ea8247ca0231d491f57cf4f11a7de94f/header.jpg?t=1756959862","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192854,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192854/movie480.mp4?t=1756959860","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192854/movie_max.mp4?t=1756959860"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192854/860ac7e55ce6cc2f07aecb4165714523a0abff4f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756959860","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192854/movie480_vp9.webm